# Working notes are not part of the shared repository.
#
# `context/` holds the handover notes, the deployment runbook, the art-direction
# critique brief and the original goal file — everything that is about BUILDING
# this rather than about running it. It stays on disk and out of git.
#
# The one document that ships is `prompt.md`: the whole project came out of a
# single prompt, and that prompt is the thing worth sharing.
*.md
!prompt.md
!README.md
context/
